#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:7 f58409a575b040fd8ec2c5a1f6f0fb2c
msgid ""
"This article provides an overview and links to the available flight modes "
"for Copter."
msgstr "本文概览 Copter 可用的飞行模式，并给出各模式的详细链接。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:11 ce6d7a2794bd429dbc72f03dbbf7e585
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概览"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:13 3ab2799b786c49ec8738f8c0beaed82c
msgid ""
"Copter has 25 flight built-in flight modes, 10 of which are regularly used. "
"There are modes to support different levels/types of flight stabilization, a"
" sophisticated autopilot, a follow-me system etc."
msgstr ""
"Copter 内置 25 种飞行模式，其中约 10 种是日常常用的。这些模式涵盖了不同级别/类型的飞行稳定、完整的自动驾驶、跟随系统等功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:17 5d83199881994a2db6a45c9e11f10298
msgid ""
"Flight modes are controlled through the radio (via a :ref:`transmitter "
"switch <common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration>`), via mission "
"commands, or using commands from a ground station (GCS) or companion "
"computer."
msgstr ""
"飞行模式可通过遥控（:ref:`遥控器开关 <common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-"
"configuration>`）切换，也可以由任务指令、地面站（GCS）或机载伴随计算机的指令切换。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:21 852b8f3305f344ad8d4ac197805c6bcb
msgid ""
"The table below shows for each flight mode whether it provides altitude or "
"position control, and whether it requires valid position information from a "
"sensor (typically a GPS) in order to arm or switch into this mode. Position "
"Control also requires a compass for good performance. In addition ALT_HOLD "
"requires an altitude sensor."
msgstr ""
"下表列出各飞行模式是否提供高度或位置控制，以及解锁或切入该模式时是否需要传感器（通常是 "
"GPS）提供有效的位置信息。位置控制还需要罗盘以保证良好性能；ALT_HOLD 则需要高度传感器。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:67 5bf7dcfdbb4142538e10e13b20221527
msgid "Recommended Flight Modes"
msgstr "推荐飞行模式"

